# Compiled Svelte bundle. It is a build product: the release workflow builds it
# into DRESearch.zip (with vendor/), which is what sites install. Run
# `npm run build` for a local checkout or before copying the module into a dev
# container. Not tracked, so dependency updates no longer need a hand-rebuilt
# bundle committed alongside them.
asset/dist/

# Playwright output (npm run test:browser)
test-results/
playwright-report/
